                       "description":  "The Step Builders page serves as a wayfinding hub for users who want to create reusable automation building blocks. Rather than presenting a single complex form, it shows a grid of builder cards so users can quickly identify and navigate to the right tool for the asset they want to create. The page heading and subtitle explain the purpose, and the card layout provides visual differentiation through color-coded icons. This is the entry point for all library asset creation outside of the workflow editor itself.",
