                       "description":  "The page presents six distinct builder types, each corresponding to a type of reusable asset in the automation library. Checks validate UI or system state. Check Groups bundle multiple checks into test suites. Shell Commands define reusable system commands. Tasks define automation work units with prompts. Contexts provide AI instructions and knowledge. Playwright Tests create browser automation scripts. Each builder type is visually distinguished with a unique color and icon, making it easy to scan and locate the desired builder.",
